    FOR EACH CROP IS COMPUTED BY MULTIPLYING THE CONSUMPTIVE IRR-
    IGATION REQUIREMENT (CIR) BY THE CROP DISTRIBUTION RATIO
    (CDR). IF WINTER WHEAT IS IN THE CROP PATTERN, THE CDR IS
    BASED ON THE ACRES OF THAT CROP HARVESTED IN THE SUMMER.


